s://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770400187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102871#issuecomment-2770400187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102871","id":2770400187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lIPO7","user":{"login":"WouterVandenputte","id":23052815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDUyODE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23052815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte","html_url":"https://github.com/WouterVandenputte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T18:53:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T18:53:02Z","body":"> > Yes I was also wondering that and already tried it. A flutter Stack over a custom AndroidFragment does work in fact. So it must be specifically the GodotFragment\n> \n> Thanks for testing it! Can you include the version with the custom AndroidFragment in your MRP as well, perhaps using another branch. I'm not familiar with flutter, but being able to evaluate your custom AndroidFragment and the GodotFragment version should help identifying the issue.\n\nThat one was still using Flutter however. I.e. Flutter in which I replaced the `GodotFragment()` with `MyBlankFragment()`(the fragment here was just a full width/height fragment with a blue background. In this setup, my Flutter widgets would render on top of them.\n\nI have been trying to make an Android only project and use the native android `StackView` but it does not seem possible to put an Android Fragment inside an Android StackView (as it isn't a view)? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770400187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776517413","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102871#issuecomment-2776517413","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102871","id":2776517413,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lfksl","user":{"login":"WouterVandenputte","id":23052815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDUyODE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23052815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte","html_url":"https://github.com/WouterVandenputte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T17:45:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T17:45:47Z","body":"> Thanks for testing it! Can you include the version with the custom AndroidFragment in your MRP as well, perhaps using another branch. I'm not familiar with flutter, but being able to evaluate your custom AndroidFragment and the GodotFragment version should help identifying the issue.\n\n[I added a new branch ](https://github.com/WouterVandenputte/godot_demo_overlay/tree/custom_fragment)that instead uses a BlankFragment() (just an empty fragment with a red background color). The selected line here is the change from the main branch.\n\n<img width=\"834\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cd265d5-50e1-41e0-809f-8bc22e799689\" />\n\nThe Flutter part perfectly renders a purple square over it\n\n<img width=\"345\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d388d2eb-4bfa-46c8-a7b0-32bd2bacd2b3\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776517413/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2927354326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102871#issuecomment-2927354326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102871","id":2927354326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ue-HW","user":{"login":"WouterVandenputte","id":23052815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDUyODE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23052815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte","html_url":"https://github.com/WouterVandenputte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-01T14:53:22Z","updated_at":"2025-06-01T14:53:22Z","body":"I checked the renderer and it occurs both on gl_compatibility and mobile","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2927354326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985358628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102871#issuecomment-2985358628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102871","id":2985358628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x8PUk","user":{"login":"WouterVandenputte","id":23052815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDUyODE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23052815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte","html_url":"https://github.com/WouterVandenputte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WouterVandenputte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T18:47:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T18:47:42Z","body":"According to ChatGPT, the problem lies in Godot's underlying `SurfaceView`, which, unlike a `TextureView` does not behave like a regular view and can't be incorporated in applications which require stacking or navigating. The TextureView does have a smaller cost attached to itself, but this is something i.m.o. the devs should be able to decide for themselves. I created [a proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12630) that allows us to choose between the two when running on Android.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985358628/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985468019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102871#issuecomment-2985468019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102871","id":2985468019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x8qBz","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T19:32:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T19:32:34Z","body":"@WouterVandenputte It's not possible for Godot to use a `TextureView` so the change will have to be in the Flutter app. According to Google, `FlutterView` can be configured to render as a [texture](https://api.flutter.dev/javadoc/io/flutter/embedding/android/RenderMode.html#texture) which allows it to be composited on top of other surfaceviews (e.g: media player integration). \n\nHave you tried that approach?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985468019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]